Look at the alternative history of Taimumari! What if the main character of the story is Kanashi? And who will be a villain?
https://store.steampowered.com/app/998580/Taimumari_Kanashimi_mode/
[b]Play a familiar game with new features![/b]
[list]
[*]The main character is Kanashi;
[*]New experience from game with distance default attack;
[*]New spells with new mechanics;
[*]Update physic for player with new jump.
[/list]
Support me and the development of Taimumari 2 by purchasing this DLC.

- Add new temporary secret passage in Fallenstar's Castle;
- Now you can go around the village in a circle

Meow :3

A new "special mode", hardcore mode for those who want to get something new from the game. Himari has only one heart of health, but endless lives! Not recommended for first play.

Other changes:
- some enemy bullets are slower;
- mana is restored more slowly, but the pause before its restoration is reduced by half;
- robots and some other enemies now stop when damaged;
- change in the number of enemies on the levels;
- a correction connected with the clinging of Himari to the walls;
- bosses no longer move during "READY GO";
- changes in the actions of certain enemies;
- changed the place of respawn in the city;
- spell re-balance, the long range of many magical abilities is reduced;
- many other small changes.

Also, please pay attention to the release of a new small game about Himari:
http://store.steampowered.com/app/634340/Legend_of_Himari

